              "description": "The nodes of the advance organizer. Each node has an `id` that edges refer to and that\nlinks it to the page with that `node-id`, a `position` and `dimension` in canvas\ncoordinates, a `label` and a `style`."
            },
            {
              "kind": "field",
              "name": "edges",
              "type": {
                "text": "Edge[]"
