              "default": "[]",
              "description": "The edges of the advance organizer. Each edge refers to its `source` and `target`\nnode by `id`, anchored at a fixed side of the node (`sourcePosition`/`targetPosition`),\nand can carry a `label` and a `style` including arrow heads at either end."
